# Per-Dockerfile ignore for .devcontainer/Dockerfile.gazebo (BuildKit feature).
# When present, this REPLACES the root .dockerignore for the gazebo build, so it
# must restate every exclusion we still want. The key difference from the root
# .dockerignore: src/mower_sim/ is NOT excluded here, because the sim image is
# built from it.
#
# Patterns are evaluated relative to the build context root (the repo root),
# even though this file lives next to the Dockerfile.

.git
.github
.claude
.vscode

build/
install/
log/
logs/
workspace/
zone_record/

# The sim image only needs mower_sim + mower_description + mower_bringup.
# Exclude every other source package to keep the build context small.
src/mower_controller/
src/mower_coverage_core/
src/mower_interface/
src/mower_mission/
src/mower_nav2/
src/mower_qt/
src/mower_teleop/
src/turtlebot3_mapviz/
src/wit_ros2_imu/

# Rust build output (not needed for the sim packages; large and host-specific)
**/target/

**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/pytest-cache-files-*/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

*.tmp
*.log
